{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund ADHD/Autism Burnout Support in all GP Surgeries Before and After Diagnosis",
        "additional_details": "GPs cannot diagnose ADHD or autism. Many people may be left without sufficient support while waiting for specialist assessments or treatment. We believe trained support is needed to help people manage symptoms before they reach crisis point.",
        "background": "Fund support for ADHD and autistic burnout so it\u2019s available through GP surgeries for people both before and after diagnosis. Many people struggle to understand and manage their symptoms, including overwhelm, exhaustion, brain fog, emotional difficulties, and loss of everyday functioning.",
